  "bodyHash": "LsDLd6O8z7g=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_0b63c3c0-86ce-4730-8b10-47be1b2cf3fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"182\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uQWvVPRHOM0?si=A_6Yw0_4DdxGRxIQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9wKugA7QeQI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>最新版的<strong>Epic Fight</strong>模組包！你將體驗最先進的Epic Fight附加模組，以及完美適配Epic Fight的各式Boss！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fP1nero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_a0578524-24fb-4dc7-a337-158912ec7065.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"141\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>注意事項：</strong></span></h1>\n<p>建議記憶體：<strong> </strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>8GB以上</strong></span></p>\n<p>不建議與朋友在同一個<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>FTB Party團隊</strong></span>中遊玩此模組包。若綁定至同一個FTB Party團隊，所有主線任務進度將會在團隊中共享，故事中的所有選擇也會同步至團隊，未在線的玩家可能會錯過重要物品！</p>\n<p>我們使用<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armourers-workshop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">armourers-workshop</a></span> </strong>作為我們的皮膚模組。我們未內建任何皮膚；所有皮膚皆需從全球資源庫取得或自行創作。<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>預告片中的部分皮膚並未公開！</strong></span> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/UfVF8b2GFk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>加入我們的Discord以獲取更多免費皮膚！</strong></span></a></p>\n<p>若你在<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>[Linux]</strong></span>上遊玩，請<strong>移除<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-physics-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Physics Remastered</a></span> </span>或將環境變數設為<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">ALSOFT_DRIVERS=pulse</span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>故事</h1>\n<p>在此模組包中，你將扮演一名來自異界的救世主，遵循守望者的指引，擊敗各式Boss，取回散落的火花，並點燃祭壇！最終挑戰終極Boss，拯救世界！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9c6ad12b-e106-4cfb-9a34-5372d6deacba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"391\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>特色介紹…</h1>\n<h2><strong>具備完整故事線的自訂對話與任務系統</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_1714559d-5b29-41d8-8885-b36d683b6541.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_053baf49-c3d7-4322-80f0-95e19eb966d2.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"325\"></p>\n<h2><strong>類似魂系列的戰鬥系統<img>搭配沉浸式教學</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_450795cb-b1f6-4f66-9d63-3b3ffbd8ca4a.gif\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<h2><strong>收錄最新一代EpicFight附加模組，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Nightfall 3.0</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">WeaponsOfMiracle2.0</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sword-soaring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwordSoaring</a></strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1343/729/569b8cca4ad3be23a1d734e17b9207b5-png.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1342/65/1c7bfa5de092b2bdd8223d617b52ae61-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<h2><strong>完全由Epic Fight打造的多樣化自訂Boss</strong></h2>\n<p><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_272a5528-2a21-43ca-ae29-392fe3ce2b46.gif\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<h2><strong>史詩級中央樞紐</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354886/description_75d3a718-44d1-4dd5-81aa-f809d3f5825d.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/P1nero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"213\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UfVF8b2GFk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"220\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/P1neapplell0/TCRCore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<h1>給翻譯者的話</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>翻譯內容可能在新版本中過時！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://github.com/P1neapplell0/TCRCore/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[點擊此處]</a></span>協助我們進行翻譯！感謝所有翻譯者！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>翻譯者名單：</strong></span></p>\n<p>（名單順序不分先後）</p>\n<p><strong>v2.0</strong></p>\n<p>西班牙語 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-casket-of-reveries-spanish-translation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[點擊此處！]西語翻譯</a></strong></p>\n<p>越南語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/cattfan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cattfan</a>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>巴西葡萄牙語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/gabriellima666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">gabriellima666</a></strong></p>\n<p>韓語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/PerFectCode0425\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PerFectCode0425</a></strong></p>\n<p>印尼語 <strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/1stsayazaki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1stsayazaki</a></strong></p>\n<p>俄語 <strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/DJDemin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DJDEMIN</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://github.com/fimkov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">fimkov</a></strong></p>\n<p>日語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/syouyu26-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">syouyu26-ui</a> </strong></p>\n<p>墨西哥西班牙語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Jotsalv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jotsalv</a></strong></p>\n<p>義大利語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/marcosaini\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">marcosaini</a></strong></p>\n<p>土耳其語 <strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/yagizomerk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">yagizomerk</a></strong></p>\n<p>法語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Sofiane-77\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sofiane-77</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>v1.0 ~ v1.7.13.2</strong></p>\n<p>日語 <a href=\"https://github.com/Tr1g7av\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Tr1g7av</strong></a></p>\n<p>韓語 <a href=\"https://github.com/TheOnlyMann\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>TheOnlyMann</strong></a></p>\n<p>法語 <a href=\"https://github.com/NshiroSama\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NshiroSama</strong></a></p>\n<p>印尼語 <a href=\"https://github.com/mriilah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>mriilah</strong></a></p>\n<p>越南語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/hoaanhmine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HMFNF</a></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>俄語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/GaylordFockerCN/TCRCore/commits?author=lacrite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">lacrite</a></strong></p>\n<p>西班牙語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/pako-art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pako-art</a></strong></p>\n<p>智利西班牙語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/valentin-marquez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">valentin-marquez</a></strong></p>\n<p>巴西葡萄牙語 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/gabriellima666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">gabriellima666</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
